  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Choose a willing creature you can see within range. Five explosive scales grow on it, granting it a +1 bonus to AC for the duration. Each time a creature hits the target with a melee attack roll before the spell ends, a scale explodes and the attacker takes 1d8 Fire damage. The spell ends early once the target has no scales left.</p><p><strong>Using a Higher-Level Spell Slot.</strong> One more explosive scale forms on the target for each spell slot level above 3.</p>",
      "chat": ""
    },
